      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TROUBLE IN ME (11) won when resuming two starts back at Young then couldn't repeat the dose last start when he led and battled on well but found one better at Young over 2100m. Not drawn to best so may need a 10/10 drive. Won't find this any harder and he can grab another win. MINOR PREMIER (9) turned in a much better run at her latest appearance when she scored by 2.5 metres over 1720m at Young. Draws out a little on the second line and may need luck at some point. Tackles a similar assignment and she can make it consecutive wins. KARINYA SOPHIE (8) is a big chance following a run of three top-three finishes, the latest at this track a week ago. Real threat to the top selections. YOUDELL (6) is the best of the rest after finishing third over 1730m at Bathurst last time out.",
